                                "sense_id": "b8709e4a-45c4-3fdb-a1f9-b207c8219743",
                                "text": "East Lodge at Queen's Park, Crewe, dates from 1887-1888. Its bressummer inscription commemorates the Jubilee of Queen Victoria and the 50th anniversary of the opening of the Grand Junction Railway."
